<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - AllStay</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="~/img/favicon.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Spectral:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script type="importmap"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/AllStay.Web.Institutional.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <!-- impeccable:direction
    THESIS: AllStay is the switchboard that used to need a human operator — now it routes guests to hotel services itself. Refuses the generic-SaaS pricing-card template and the tropical-beach-app cliché both.
    OWN-WORLD: dark walnut/bakelite panel (near-black warm ground) with brass hardware and a single reserved orange "lit jack" accent (AllStay's own orange); docket-slip mono labels, engraved-caps display type, ruled ledger rows instead of icon cards.
    STORY: a hotel GM sees the exact mechanism (a routed connection, guest→service) in the first viewport, understands AllStay replaces front-desk friction, and books a sales conversation.
    FIRST VIEWPORT: full-bleed dark switchboard panel — a row of brass jacks with one lit, a patch cable resolving into "ROOM 214 → SPA 11:30 · RESERVADO", headline at scale, two engraved-toggle CTAs.
    FORM: Hotel Switchboard, assigned index 6 of 7 grounded hospitality-world directions; seed key 2868cbe0; raised with an instrument-panel discipline (tabular gauge-style stat numerals) donated from a competitive night-flight-instrument-panel challenger.
    FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md.
    -->
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-sm sticky-top">
            <div class="container">
                <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2" asp-area="" asp-page="/Index">
                    <img src="~/img/logo.png" alt="AllStay" height="28" />
                    All<span class="accent">Stay</span>
                </a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target=".navbar-collapse" aria-controls="navbarSupportedContent"
                        aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="navbar-collapse collapse d-sm-inline-flex justify-content-between">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav flex-grow-1 justify-content-end align-items-sm-center gap-sm-4">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-page="/Index" asp-fragment="produto">Produto</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-page="/Index" asp-fragment="precos">Planos</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="btn btn-brand btn-sm" asp-page="/Contact">Falar com vendas</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main role="main">
        @RenderBody()
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between gap-2">
            <span>&copy; 2026 AllStay. Concierge digital para hotéis 4 e 5 estrelas.</span>
            <a asp-page="/Contact">Contato</a>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>

    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
